  "displayLabel": "Company service price",
  "methodology": {
    "description": "Illustrative sample of publicly listed law-firm legal fees retained as provenance for company service prices selected by the user; not a U.S. national average.",
    "calculation": "For each benchmark, average the midpoint of each included observed range. Exact fees have identical endpoints. Round the arithmetic mean to two decimals.",
    "range": "Minimum and maximum are the envelope of included observations, not a confidence interval.",
    "minimumComparableFirms": 2,
    "sampling": "Convenience sample from accessible primary law-firm fee pages; not random, exhaustive, geographically weighted or adjusted for service quality.",
    "comparability": "Separate standalone filings, joint cases, renewals, bundles, review-only work and add-ons. Excluded observations remain visible for scope transparency.",
    "freshness": "Checked date means the source page was inspected on that date; most source firms give no fee-effective date. Source observations remain research provenance and do not establish their current availability.",
    "governmentFees": "Only attorney/legal-fee figures are stored. Government filing fees, medical exams, translations and third-party costs are separate; ambiguous source wording is flagged.",
    "display": "Display servicePriceUsd as the fixed company price when status is fixed. Display Quote required when no benchmark exists. Preserve benchmark and observations as research provenance rather than displaying an estimate as the company price.",
    "engagement": "User selection establishes the company pricing policy only; it does not confirm acceptance by the source law firms, create an attorney-client relationship, or guarantee a case outcome."
  },
